# Every text file is LF, in the index and on disk, on every platform. Two
# kinds of file are compared byte for byte with text the tests write back —
# the frame graph goldens (`crates/ae_render/tests/golden/*.dot`) and the game
# content (`games/*/content/.../units.json`, which the catalogue test requires
# to be in canonical form) — so a Windows checkout under `core.autocrlf`
# fails them while every line matches.
* text=auto eol=lf
